SUMMARY:THE MONSTERS (sui) (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Arena
DESCRIPTION: | Arena Wien - Kleine Halle | "Off the Road" Tour 2026  The Monsters are a riotous\, 200mph three-piece* punk outfit\, formed in the city of Bern\, the sleepy smalltown capital of Switzerland.  But how does one describe The Monsters? Garage rock Certainly. Psychobilly? They have elements of it. Trash Definitely\, but that doesn’t capture their full essence. Punk Absolutely. Grindcore\, rockabilly\, boogie\, metal… Yes\, exactly. They’re all that\, and more: kind\, grateful\, hilarious\, energetic\, no-holds-barred rock‘n’roll\, 187% no top 100 shit\, simple One-Riff-Trash.  The Monsters played Europe\, Asia\, las Americas\, Africa and everywhere in between with greats like Guitar Wolf\, Death\, The Sonics\, Ty Segall and Black Lips in countless fancy places like CBGBs and DIY punkholes around the world as well as festivals like Speedfest\, Cosmic Trip\, Sjock\, We’re Loud Fest (Asia\, Africa)\, Bad Bonn Chilbi\, Muddy Roots and many more.  They played on a whole lot of recordings and will release their latest\, newest\, most recent and most exciting platter in late 2026\, followed by tours-a-gogo through the world. Because this is just what they do.  Go see them while you can.  *Actually they are a 4-piece since they welcomed the soundguy to the group to save his salary. Cheaty-bastardo-monster-move.  themonsters.ch  Vorverkauf/Presale Arena Shop € 22\,50 (+ € 2\,50 Fee) Abendkassa/Box-office tba.
URL:https://arena.wien/Home/Programm-Detail/concert-id/48591
